Package: dux-icons
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3:any,
         hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Icon theme generator that follows your Material colors
 Dux Icons builds a freedesktop icon theme of scalable SVGs from the
 desktop's Material colors: each installed app's own icon framed on a common
 badge, plus folders, places and file types drawn for the theme. DMS
 rebuilds it on every wallpaper or theme change; elsewhere run dux-icons
 with the colors to use.
